      "message": "fix(project)!: declare tap-hand project file compatibility barrier\n\nRecord the compatibility change introduced by c51f5541 without rewriting the reviewed history. Keep the version 62 barrier that protects saved tap handedness.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Saved projects now use format version 62. Older Camcraft readers refuse these files instead of silently dropping tap handedness. New readers continue to accept older projects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\nFixes #1453",
